143
00:08:41.988 --> 00:08:42.841
Fan-out.

144
00:08:43.121 --> 00:08:43.996
Example:

145
00:08:44.276 --> 00:08:48.585
One order.placed, then picking, notifications, loyalty, analytics.

146
00:08:48.865 --> 00:08:49.591
Cost:

147
00:08:49.871 --> 00:08:53.092
Every consumer must handle duplicates and reordering.

148
00:08:53.372 --> 00:08:54.396
Load leveling.

149
00:08:54.676 --> 00:08:55.551
Example:

150
00:08:55.831 --> 00:09:01.207
A burst of 20 K orders per minute is absorbed and consumed at a sustainable rate.

151
00:09:01.487 --> 00:09:02.212
Cost:

152
