Queue or lag growth becomes a capacity problem.

153
00:09:05.737 --> 00:09:07.444
Replay or new consumers.

154
00:09:07.724 --> 00:09:08.599
Example:

155
00:09:08.879 --> 00:09:11.439
A fraud model reads 30 days of history.

156
00:09:11.719 --> 00:09:12.444
Cost:

157
00:09:12.724 --> 00:09:14.665
Storage and retention design.

158
00:09:14.945 --> 00:09:16.375
Failure isolation.

159
00:09:16.655 --> 00:09:17.529
Example:

160
00:09:17.809 --> 00:09:20.305
A slow SMS vendor doesn't slow checkout.

161
00:09:20.585 --> 00:09:21.311
