0.

259
00:15:52.859 --> 00:16:00.581
Notes: ...until a disk dies while the ISR is just the leader (below). acks=all, min.insync=1, unclean.

260
00:16:00.861 --> 00:16:01.971
Acked-but-lost:

261
00:16:02.251 --> 00:16:04.683
15,566.

262
