528
00:30:24.315 --> 00:30:26.043
Architecture and Diagrams.

529
00:30:27.293 --> 00:30:29.384
Component view: the event backbone.

530
00:30:29.664 --> 00:30:31.008
Here is the diagram.

531
00:30:34.858 --> 00:30:41.002
Each consumer group reads the same topic independently, at its own pace, and fails independently.

532
00:30:41.282 --> 00:30:44.077
Notifications' retries don't delay picking.

533
00:30:45.427 --> 00:30:50.184
Sequence: happy path, publish with acks=all and consume at least once.

534
00:30:50.464 --> 00:30:53.131
The sequence diagram walks through it step by step.

535
00:30:53.411 --> 00:31:00.301
R to L: produce ord-1001 placed, pid 17 seq 4210, acks all.

536
00:31:00.581 --> 00:31:04.357
L to L: append at offset 90211.

537
00:31:04.637 --> 00:31:08.221
F1 to L: fetch from 90211.

538
00:31:08.501 --> 00:31:12.064
F2 to L: fetch from 90211.

539
00:31:12.344 --> 00:31:15.885
L to F1: record 90211.

540
00:31:16.165 --> 00:31:19.664
L to F2: record 90211.

541
00:31:19.944 --> 00:31:26.856
F1 to L: next fetch from 90212 acknowledges 90211.

542
00:31:27.136 --> 00:31:28.011
L to L:

543
00:31:28.291 --> 00:31:33.091
HW advances to 90212, ISR all have it.

544
00:31:33.371 --> 00:31:36.912
L to R: ack offset 90211.

545
00:31:37.192 --> 00:31:40.456
C to L: fetch partition 6 from committed offset.

546
00:31:40.736 --> 00:31:43.168
L to C: records up to HW.

547
00:31:43.448 --> 00:31:47.693
C to C: inbox insert plus effect in one DB transaction.

548
00:31:47.973 --> 00:31:51.323
C to L: commit offset 90212.

549
00:31:55.173 --> 00:31:58.863
Sequence: failure path, a poison message and a leader failure.

550
00:31:59.143 --> 00:32:01.810
The sequence diagram walks through it step by step.

551
00:32:02.090 --> 00:32:04.245
C to T: poll partition 3.

552
00:32:04.525 --> 00:32:09.218
T to C: offset 5501 malformed phone number.

553
00:32:09.498 --> 00:32:12.463
C to C: non-retryable, validation error.

554
00:32:12.743 --> 00:32:17.202
C to D: publish with headers original offset, exception, attempts 1.

555
00:32:17.482 --> 00:32:22.709
C to T: commit 5502 and continue, no partition stall.

556
00:32:22.989 --> 00:32:27.917
T to C: offset 5502 SMS vendor timeout.

557
00:32:28.197 --> 00:32:31.589
C to RT: publish with attempt 1, due in 10 s.

558
00:32:31.869 --> 00:32:34.983
C to T: commit 5503.

559
00:32:35.263 --> 00:32:37.631
R to T: produce to partition 6.

560
00:32:37.911 --> 00:32:38.871
T to R:

561
00:32:39.151 --> 00:32:40.943
NOTLEADER, metadata refresh.

562
00:32:41.223 --> 00:32:45.469
K to K: elect broker-1 from ISR, leader epoch 12.

563
00:32:45.749 --> 00:32:49.141
R to T: retry same pid and seq to broker-1.

564
00:32:49.421 --> 00:32:52.834
T to R: ack, deduplicated if it had already landed.

565
00:32:56.684 --> 00:32:58.497
State: a consumer group member.

566
00:32:58.777 --> 00:33:00.121
