00:39:52.845 --> 00:39:53.527
8.

686
00:39:53.807 --> 00:39:54.959
Failure modes.

687
00:39:55.239 --> 00:39:56.263
Broker loss:

688
00:39:56.543 --> 00:40:00.042
ISR leader election, producers retry (idempotent).

689
00:40:00.322 --> 00:40:01.346
AZ loss:

690
00:40:01.626 --> 00:40:05.466
2 of 3 replicas remain, writes continue (min ISR 2).

691
00:40:05.746 --> 00:40:10.930
Two brokers lost: writes to affected partitions are refused (no silent loss).

692
00:40:11.210 --> 00:40:12.319
Poison message:

693
00:40:12.599 --> 00:40:13.581
DLT.

694
00:40:13.861 --> 00:40:19.749
Slow consumer: lag alert, scale up to the partition count, degrade non-critical consumers.

695
00:40:20.029 --> 00:40:23.549
Schema break: rejected by the registry at produce time.

696
00:40:24.899 --> 00:40:25.603
10.

697
00:40:25.883 --> 00:40:26.971
Observability.

698
00:40:27.251 --> 00:40:33.117
Per group: lag in records and seconds (Burrow or exporter), rebalances per hour, commit rate.

699
00:40:33.397 --> 00:40:41.077
Per topic: bytes in or out, under-replicated and under-min-ISR partitions (page), offline partitions (page).

700
00:40:41.357 --> 00:40:44.365
Producer: error rate, retries, record-queue-time.

701
00:40:44.645 --> 00:40:49.467
DLT: message rate and age of oldest (page if 0 for tier 1).

702
00:40:49.747 --> 00:40:51.752
Registry: rejected schemas.

703
00:40:53.102 --> 00:40:53.955
14.

704
00:40:54.235 --> 00:40:58.715
Decision (ADR-053 to 057 summary).

705
00:40:58.995 --> 00:41:00.873
Kafka is the event backbone.

706
00:41:01.153 --> 00:41:06.955
Keys are aggregate ids, and partitions are sized with headroom and never changed in place.

707
00:41:07.235 --> 00:41:14.147
RF 3 or min ISR 2 or acks=all or idempotent producers or no unclean election.

708
00:41:14.427 --> 00:41:21.147
Consumers use cooperative-sticky assignment, static membership, commit-after-processing and idempotent effects.

709
00:41:21.427 --> 00:41:25.203
Poison messages go through retry topics to owned DLTs.

710
00:41:25.483 --> 00:41:29.665
Avro schemas are enforced as backward compatible by a registry.

